      "value": "@{64873f159cf028090ce2c2e2|full_name} Hey, It's a consistent behaviour on every model/bone-chain/rig where I want to use Gravity in combination with Gravity Fallof and toggling the Physbone script.\n\nHere's an example in Unity 2022.3.6f1 & SDK 3.5.2, with a default Physbone 1.1 script, ticking the \"Is Animated\" and \"Reset when Disabled\" boxes in the later part.\n\nhttps://streamable.com/cqfqbs",
